  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "协议适配前置 (ADR-0010)",
      "items": [
        "Rust 层已无任何方言知识：供应商差异 (OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini/Qwen/自定义 Base URL) 全部收敛在 TS adapters/",
        "Rust client.rs 只做 http_fetch 载荷最小校验 + 透传宿主 host-http；SSE 语义由前端 sse.ts 解析",
        "streamEvent 字段为流式请求必填，非流式 (chat-complete / fetch-models) 不要求"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "数据真源在插件私有目录",
      "items": [
        "文件访问一律经宿主 host-fs (sync import) —— 不经 WASI preopen：WASI fs 在 p3 下是 async func，与 sync 导出冲突 (ADR 0034)",
        "数据根固定为宿主绝对路径 {home}/.bedcode/ai-chatbox/；activate 阶段经 fs_request_auth 集中授权一次并持久化记住",
        "JSONL 结构：conversations/{id}.jsonl (首行 meta + 逐行消息) · index.jsonl (updatedAt DESC) · providers.json"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "限流重试与错误处理",
      "items": [
        "限流码 (429/503/529) 按指数退避自动重试：次数 (0=关闭, 默认 3) · 初始等待 (1000ms) · 封顶 (30000ms) 均可配",
        "思考模式 (default/enabled/disabled) 与推理强度 (low/high/max) 与展示开关独立控制",
        "限流与错误信息透传前端，前端统一 logger 显示；不做静默降级"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "权限与命令面",
      "items": [
        "权限：broadcast · fs:read · fs:write · network:http · storage · ui:sidebar",
        "8 条命令：chat-stream · chat-complete · fetch-models · list-conversations · get-messages · save-conversation · save-message · delete-conversation",
        "前端 UI 只经 invoke_command 到 Rust，Rust 再走 host-* 原语——无前端直接网络或文件访问 (AGENTS.md §6)"
      ]
    }
  ]
